msgstr "Hear the voice and follow the words."

#. Two versions of one sentence: the part in tag 1 is read when the page runs with JavaScript, the part in tag 2 when it does not. Write both.
#. Tags in the text (move the words, keep every tag, each inside the same tag):
#.   <1> = <span class="con-js">
#.   <2> = <span class="senza-js">
#: index.html
#, kalliope-markup
msgctxt "campioni.testo"
msgid "Le frasi sono tue, dette con le registrazioni vere di Kalliope 0.1-rc.1. <1>Scegli la voce, poi premi una frase: le parole si accendono mentre Paola, Luca e Anna la sentono.</1><2>Premi il lettore sotto ogni frase per ascoltarla. Accanto trovi il collegamento alla stessa frase con la voce di Marco.</2>"
msgstr "Hear your part in the meeting in recordings made with Kalliope 0.1-rc.1. <1>Choose a voice, then select a sentence. The words light up as Paola, Luca and Anna hear them.</1><2>Use the player below each sentence to hear it. The link beside it plays the same sentence in Marco’s voice.</2>"

