#. The hint under the writing box: Enter says the sentence, Esc stops the voice, ↑ brings back the last sentence. Keys named as on the keyboard of the language.
#: crates/app/ui/kalliope/scrittura.slint
#, kalliope-slint
msgctxt "programma.scrittura.invio-dice-esc-ferma"
